    robosub_gate              robosub_octagon_animals   nutbolt
    robosub_slalom            robosub_buoy              pill
    robosub_path              robosub_bottle            electric
    robosub_bin               robosub_ladle             bandaid
    robosub_torpedo           water_bottle
    robosub_octagon

The course layout in worlds/robosub_2026.world is likewise theirs, from their
semi_final_pool.world / start_pool_world.launch.

Local change: the models were authored for Gazebo Classic and used Ogre
material scripts (materials/scripts/*.material).  Those cannot be rendered by
Gazebo Sim, so every <material><script> block in the SDF files was rewritten
as a PBR <albedo_map> pointing at the same texture.  The original .material
files are kept alongside the textures for reference.

models/pool is from a different source - see models/pool/NOTICE.

